  "tagline": "Bridal Makeup • Soft Glam • Photoshoot & Event Makeup in Brooklyn",
  "description": "Bridal Makeup Artist Brooklyn\nMariami Melikidze is a professional makeup artist based in Brooklyn, New York. She creates polished, personalized looks for brides, photoshoots and special events. Her services include bridal makeup, wedding makeup, soft glam and camera-ready makeup designed to complement each client’s features, personal style, outfit and occasion.\n\nClients can request a natural, glowing finish or a more defined glamorous look. Before booking, contact Mariami to discuss the event date, preferred style and availability. Sharing inspiration photos in advance can help communicate the desired result and make the appointment easier to plan.\nProfessional Makeup Services\n\nBridal makeup: elegant wedding-day makeup tailored to the bride’s features and preferred style.\nSoft glam: a balanced, refined look suitable for weddings, engagements, dinners and celebrations.\nPhotoshoot makeup: camera-ready makeup for portraits, branding sessions and professional photography.\nSpecial event makeup: customized looks for birthdays, graduations, parties and other important occasions.\n\nPlanning Your Makeup Appointment\nFor the best result, prepare details about the event, timing, outfit and preferred makeup style before contacting the artist. Clients may also ask about appointment length, preparation recommendations and current availability. Exact pricing and booking conditions should be confirmed directly with Mariami.\n\nCommunication is available in Georgian, English and Russian. Appointments are required, and clients can reach Mariami by phone, WhatsApp, email or through her makeup portfolio on Instagram.\nქართველი ვიზაჟისტი ბრუკლინში\nმარიამი მელიქიძე გთავაზობთ პროფესიონალურ საქორწილო მაკიაჟს, Soft Glam-ს, ფოტოსესიისა და განსაკუთრებული ღონისძიებების მაკიაჟს ბრუკლინში. თითოეული სტილი იქმნება კლიენტის სურვილის, სახის ნაკვთებისა და ღონისძიების ხასიათის გათვალისწინებით.\n\nსასურველი სტილის, თარიღისა და თავისუფალი დროის დასაზუსტებლად დაუკავშირდით წინასწარ. დამატებითი ადგილობრივი მომსახურებების სანახავად გაეცანით სილამაზის სპეციალისტებს და სხვა ქართულ ბიზნესებს ბრუკლინში.\n\nProfessional makeup can help create a consistent, photo-ready finish throughout an important event. Clients are encouraged to discuss skin preferences, desired coverage and the overall mood of the look when arranging an appointment.\n\nLocation: Brooklyn, New York\nServices: Bridal Makeup, Wedding Makeup, Soft Glam, Photoshoot Makeup and Special Event Makeup\nLanguages: Georgian, English and Russian",
